      (1 + cutTail Cd.z.dim Cd.δ Cd.Kt) ^ 4 * multTail Cd.z.dim Cd.δ'' D.S.Q0 Cd.Cm Cd.Kt)) +
    max ((Real.pi * kerC κ' 0 + 2 * (2 * 4 * (2 * 4 * (2 * Real.pi * 4 *
        kernelDerivBound κ' 0)))) * (dyadicGridLength A.G I.1 * Cd.ε /
          (D.S.Q0 * ((6 ^ h' : ℕ) : ℝ))))
