        Cd.U₀) ^ Cd.Jk)⁻¹) *
      (frequencyBox (Cd.z.dim + Cd.z.dim) (2 ^ (Cd.Kt + 1))).card *
      (frequencyBox Cd.z.dim (2 ^ (Cd.Kt + 1))).card ^ 4

/-- The absolute error constant of a four-core tuple at torus height `h'`: numerical, coset and
