      dyadicGridLength A.G I.1 * (D.refT3 G I l a xs + ∑ i, ((expP2 (6 ^ h') (D.S.Q0 * 6 ^ h')
        (sideOptN nn) x - ((l : ℕ) : ℤ) • expP1 (6 ^ h') (D.S.Q0 * 6 ^ h') (sideOptN nn) x) i :
